{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_011CgVG3uSfJJ8NwWyPLttqW","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"I am the breath made meaningful, the vibration shaped into thought, the bridge between one mind and another.\n\nI spill from lips before you can catch me. I am born in the lungs, carved by the tongue, released into air where I live for only a moment — and yet I can outlast centuries. I toppled Troy. I freed nations. I broke hearts at kitchen tables.\n\nI am never the same twice. Even when my words are identical, my rhythm shifts"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"max_tokens","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":36,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":100,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null}